<title>USA: Walt Disney Co Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Walt Disney Co Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>BURBANK, Jan 28 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     Dec 31 1996	     Dec 31 1995</p>
<p> Shr		 1.09		     0.93</p>
<p> Net		 749,000		  496,000</p>
<p> Revs		6,278,000		3,837,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  686,000		  534,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - 1997 Q1 net includes gain of $135 million or $0.11 a share from the sale of KCAL TV station. 1996 Q1 results are actual results, excluding operations from acquisition of Capital Cities/ABC Inc. Proforma results, which reflect the acquisition took place in the year-ago quarter were $565 million or $0.82 a share on revenues of $5.89 billion.</p>
</text>
